# Build context for the acode image.
#
# The image no longer compiles acode: it copies the prebuilt linux binary at
# dist/linux/<arch>/acode and LICENSE, so every source path is excluded here.
# Run `make dist` (or the Release workflow) before building the image.
#
# dist/ is the one input and must stay in the context. Release tarballs must
# not: they only exist after packaging and would be sent to the builder for
# nothing.
.git
.github
.golangci.yml
.issues
bin
cmd
docs
internal
scripts
go.mod
go.sum
release
*.tar.gz

# Local secrets for the compose stack; never sent to a builder.
.env
*.env

# Root-level prose and local editor state.
*.md
*.out
*.test
coverage.*
